        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\sin A=\\dfrac{h}{c}$, so $h=c\\sin A$.",
          "worked": "In the right triangle formed by the perpendicular height,\n$$\\begin{align*}\\sin A&=\\frac{h}{c}\\\\h&=c\\sin A.\\end{align*}$$",
